Use 'SpawnableObject' instead of 'SpawnObject'; spawning a spawn is redundant, similar to PIN number vs. PIN  

OLD: 
  public SpawnObject[] objectsToSpawn;

NEW:
  public SpawnableObject[] objectsToSpawn;

